      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلْطٌ</span></b>  <i>A brand upon the side of the cheek of a
camel:</i> (IDrd, O: [see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِلَاطٌ</span>:]) or <i>the scar
